  "decision_conditions": [
    "The side extension along the boundary with number 37, due to its siting and significant and inappropriate depth, as well as its height, bulk and scale, is out-of-keeping with the character, form and pattern of development in the immediate surrounding area and it does not demonstrate a high quality of design. Therefore, the proposal is contrary to policy CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010), to policies DMD8, DMD11, and DMD37 of the Development Management Document (2014), to policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), and to chapter 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2023).",
    "The side extension along the boundary with number 37, by reason of its significant and inappropriate depth, height, design, siting, and scale and massing would adversely affect the amenities and rear amenity space of the occupiers of the adjoining property no. 37 through increased enclosure, loss of outlook and overbearing impacts resulting in an unneighbourly form of development. Therefore, the proposal is contrary to policy CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010), to policies DMD8, DMD11, and DMD37 of the Development Management Document (2014), to policy D3 of the London Plan (2021) and to chapter 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2023)."
  ],
